[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l007","ordinal":96513,"en":"Thinking of her honor, my sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l008","ordinal":96514,"en":"A widow, stirred with excitement,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l009","ordinal":96515,"en":"Among Bukhara's eight city khans,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l010","ordinal":96516,"en":"Was seized with the wish to race her horse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l011","ordinal":96517,"en":"I heard she made a test of fate:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l012","ordinal":96518,"en":"If her bay horse came first,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l013","ordinal":96519,"en":"She would share the chief prize;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l014","ordinal":96520,"en":"If her bay horse fell behind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l015","ordinal":96521,"en":"My dear sister"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l016","ordinal":96522,"en":"Would die before her appointed death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l017","ordinal":96523,"en":"If there were a way in this world,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l018","ordinal":96524,"en":"She would see some good fortune."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l019","ordinal":96525,"en":"As a test of fate, Taytoru"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l020","ordinal":96526,"en":"Was the horse she raced, I heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l021","ordinal":96527,"en":"Let us cry, 'Baabedin!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l022","ordinal":96528,"en":"This is the day of the poor."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l023","ordinal":96529,"en":"Let us watch, champions!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l024","ordinal":96530,"en":"A shrill, shrill, shrill sound rises;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l025","ordinal":96531,"en":"The voice screams piercingly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l026","ordinal":96532,"en":"At the end of the scream"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l027","ordinal":96533,"en":"She earnestly cries, 'My lord!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l028","ordinal":96534,"en":"Having wandered to Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l029","ordinal":96535,"en":"It is my sister's voice."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l030","ordinal":96536,"en":"Every wish of hers, the one God—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l031","ordinal":96537,"en":"Perhaps he has granted them this day!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l032","ordinal":96538,"en":"My unfortunate sister's Taytoru,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l033","ordinal":96539,"en":"Contending for the lead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l034","ordinal":96540,"en":"Perhaps has reached us on this day."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l035","ordinal":96541,"en":"For my poor, fierce sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l036","ordinal":96542,"en":"God has surely opened fortune's door."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l037","ordinal":96543,"en":"For my unfortunate, fierce sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l038","ordinal":96544,"en":"God has surely opened the way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0258:b004:l039","ordinal":96545,"en":"'Live out the days written for you,' he says,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l001","ordinal":96546,"en":"Such must be the writing of the Creator."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l002","ordinal":96547,"en":"The one God has granted her wish:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l003","ordinal":96548,"en":"The horse running at the head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l004","ordinal":96549,"en":"Must be my sister's horse called Taytoru."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l005","ordinal":96550,"en":"When that poor woman lamented,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l006","ordinal":96551,"en":"God must have granted her wish!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l007","ordinal":96552,"en":"With hoe-like hooves and broad haunches,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l008","ordinal":96553,"en":"The courser of the open land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l009","ordinal":96554,"en":"Handsome Taytoru,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l010","ordinal":96555,"en":"Must have moved into the lead."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l011","ordinal":96556,"en":"For my poor, unfortunate sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l012","ordinal":96557,"en":"God must have lifted her gloom.'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l013","ordinal":96558,"en":"Then, saying these words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l014","ordinal":96559,"en":"The marvelous orphan Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l015","ordinal":96560,"en":"His many cares overflowing his breast,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l016","ordinal":96561,"en":"Longed to witness this affair;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l017","ordinal":96562,"en":"His tears streamed ten ways."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l018","ordinal":96563,"en":"Upon a ridge like a saddle's back,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l019","ordinal":96564,"en":"Semetey tossed restlessly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l020","ordinal":96565,"en":"His tears streamed ten ways:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l021","ordinal":96566,"en":"Semetey stood weeping!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l022","ordinal":96567,"en":"Without looking about him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l023","ordinal":96568,"en":"Like a man staggering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l024","ordinal":96569,"en":"Sparing himself not at all,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l025","ordinal":96570,"en":"He turned his courser's head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l026","ordinal":96571,"en":"Semetey, the hawk's surviving son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l027","ordinal":96572,"en":"Looked straight across."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l028","ordinal":96573,"en":"Upon the fearsome headland,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l029","ordinal":96574,"en":"At the spur of the winding mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l030","ordinal":96575,"en":"It had lowered its head to the ground:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l031","ordinal":96576,"en":"That wondrous, mighty beast"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l032","ordinal":96577,"en":"Had begun to run as never before."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l033","ordinal":96578,"en":"It had lowered its neck to the ground:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l034","ordinal":96579,"en":"The well-shaped racer Taytoru"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l035","ordinal":96580,"en":"Ran irresistibly onward."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l036","ordinal":96581,"en":"Among six hundred and forty-three coursers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l037","ordinal":96582,"en":"It had broken away at the head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l038","ordinal":96583,"en":"Until it reached the halfway point,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b003:l039","ordinal":96584,"en":"It had contended with Aktulpar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l001","ordinal":96585,"en":"Its eyes reddening like a gazelle's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l002","ordinal":96586,"en":"Ahead of Aktulpar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l003","ordinal":96587,"en":"Taytoru had moved,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l004","ordinal":96588,"en":"Stretching seven bowshots clear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l005","ordinal":96589,"en":"Its body had warmed up;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l006","ordinal":96590,"en":"The racer sixty years beyond its first four"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l007","ordinal":96591,"en":"Now exerted its strength."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l008","ordinal":96592,"en":"The ground beneath it crumbled;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l009","ordinal":96593,"en":"Clods as large as a great cauldron"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l010","ordinal":96594,"en":"Whirled above its head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l011","ordinal":96595,"en":"Its stride stretched like a wild ewe's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l012","ordinal":96596,"en":"Its eyes reddened like a wild ram's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l013","ordinal":96597,"en":"Its mouth gaped like a ravenous maw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l014","ordinal":96598,"en":"White foam mixed with blood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l015","ordinal":96599,"en":"Spattered its breast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l016","ordinal":96600,"en":"It rattled its bit,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l017","ordinal":96601,"en":"And its tail like strands of silk"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l018","ordinal":96602,"en":"Lashed between its hind legs."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l019","ordinal":96603,"en":"Taytoru was coming,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l020","ordinal":96604,"en":"Racing a bird in flight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l021","ordinal":96605,"en":"The white reins with knotted loops"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l022","ordinal":96606,"en":"Were gripped tight in both hands."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l023","ordinal":96607,"en":"Torment no one should endure—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l024","ordinal":96608,"en":"My valiant sister Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l025","ordinal":96609,"en":"Was coming through it all."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l026","ordinal":96610,"en":"At the racer Taytoru,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l027","ordinal":96611,"en":"My wretched, leopard-like sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l028","ordinal":96612,"en":"With blank charges,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l029","ordinal":96613,"en":"Kept making booming blows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l030","ordinal":96614,"en":"Firing as she came."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l031","ordinal":96615,"en":"My dear elder sister Kanykei—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l032","ordinal":96616,"en":"Cursed be her widowhood!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l033","ordinal":96617,"en":"From her dear, quail-like eyes"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l034","ordinal":96618,"en":"Tears fell in separate streams."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l035","ordinal":96619,"en":"From her dear eyes like currants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l036","ordinal":96620,"en":"From my fierce, dear sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l037","ordinal":96621,"en":"Tears streamed a whip's length."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l038","ordinal":96622,"en":"Many cares overflowed her breast;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0259:b005:l039","ordinal":96623,"en":"Her tears streamed a thousand ways."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l001","ordinal":96624,"en":"My dear, poor sister's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l002","ordinal":96625,"en":"Bloody face was torn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l003","ordinal":96626,"en":"Her black hair spread loose,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l004","ordinal":96627,"en":"Her widowhood plain to see,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l005","ordinal":96628,"en":"A great black covering upon her head."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l006","ordinal":96629,"en":"Her Akborchuk paced along;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l007","ordinal":96630,"en":"Bloody tears, mingled with blood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l008","ordinal":96631,"en":"From Akborchuk's mane"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l009","ordinal":96632,"en":"Streamed a whip's length down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l010","ordinal":96633,"en":"Manas, whose spirit was noble,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l011","ordinal":96634,"en":"She had all but glimpsed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l012","ordinal":96635,"en":"Weeping breathlessly and screaming,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l013","ordinal":96636,"en":"Halfway along the road, Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l014","ordinal":96637,"en":"When she saw his spirit,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l015","ordinal":96638,"en":"Had nearly died."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l016","ordinal":96639,"en":"Tearing both her cheeks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l017","ordinal":96640,"en":"She had fallen into anguish."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l018","ordinal":96641,"en":"As though her lord, heroic Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l019","ordinal":96642,"en":"Had died this very day,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l020","ordinal":96643,"en":"She had begun lamenting Manas again."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l021","ordinal":96644,"en":"Seeing her lament,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l022","ordinal":96645,"en":"The boy's heart was wounded."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l023","ordinal":96646,"en":"The sixty distinguished champions—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l024","ordinal":96647,"en":"Their hearts ached, every one."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l025","ordinal":96648,"en":"Once he had seen his sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l026","ordinal":96649,"en":"The marvelous hero Semetey,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l027","ordinal":96650,"en":"Shouting, 'Manas! Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l028","ordinal":96651,"en":"Came out from the bank,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l029","ordinal":96652,"en":"Raising the battle cry, 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l030","ordinal":96653,"en":"When the boy cried, 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l031","ordinal":96654,"en":"The whole hollow rang with shouting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l032","ordinal":96655,"en":"All the hills and hollows"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l033","ordinal":96656,"en":"Raised the battle cry, 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l034","ordinal":96657,"en":"The young hawk Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l035","ordinal":96658,"en":"Did not hush his shouting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l036","ordinal":96659,"en":"His battle cry of 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l037","ordinal":96660,"en":"The boy did not still then."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l038","ordinal":96661,"en":"Upon the courser beneath him"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b003:l039","ordinal":96662,"en":"He laid the whip from side to side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l001","ordinal":96663,"en":"Spurring left and right."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l002","ordinal":96664,"en":"He raised a mighty battle cry."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l003","ordinal":96665,"en":"'My magnanimous brother-in-law Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l004","ordinal":96666,"en":"Semetey roared,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l005","ordinal":96667,"en":"Drew alongside and took the lead rope."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l006","ordinal":96668,"en":"He opened his mouth with an 'Ah!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l007","ordinal":96669,"en":"The white lead rope with knotted loops"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l008","ordinal":96670,"en":"He snatched from the boy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l009","ordinal":96671,"en":"(From this side of the open plain)."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l010","ordinal":96672,"en":"Then the marvelous young hero"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l011","ordinal":96673,"en":"Pressed it to his breast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l012","ordinal":96674,"en":"Tirelessly, young Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l013","ordinal":96675,"en":"Drew Taytoru along."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l014","ordinal":96676,"en":"Shouting, 'Manas! Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l015","ordinal":96677,"en":"Raising the battle cry, 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l016","ordinal":96678,"en":"He urged Taytoru onward."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l017","ordinal":96679,"en":"The boy looked behind him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l018","ordinal":96680,"en":"Thinking of his elder sister."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l019","ordinal":96681,"en":"His dear sister Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l020","ordinal":96682,"en":"With a great black covering on her head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l021","ordinal":96683,"en":"Bereft of her blood-shedding lord,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l022","ordinal":96684,"en":"At thirty-two years of age"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l023","ordinal":96685,"en":"Had become a helpless old woman."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l024","ordinal":96686,"en":"Fleeing and wandering to Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l025","ordinal":96687,"en":"The poor wretch had grown thin."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l026","ordinal":96688,"en":"The wise, fierce, marvelous hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l027","ordinal":96689,"en":"The capable boy, spoke these words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l029","ordinal":96690,"en":"Bereft of your magnanimous lord,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l030","ordinal":96691,"en":"You came destitute to Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l031","ordinal":96692,"en":"My sorrow-laden unfortunate!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l032","ordinal":96693,"en":"Ah, my darling elder sister,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l033","ordinal":96694,"en":"I shall not let a hawk devour the swan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l034","ordinal":96695,"en":"Unless this wretched head of mine should die,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l035","ordinal":96696,"en":"I shall not let them call you a wretched woman!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l036","ordinal":96697,"en":"I shall not let a hawk devour the goose."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l037","ordinal":96698,"en":"Unless this dear head of mine should die,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l038","ordinal":96699,"en":"I shall not let them call you a fugitive woman!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0260:b004:l039","ordinal":96700,"en":"While this dear head remains alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l001","ordinal":96701,"en":"I shall not let the winged strike you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l002","ordinal":96702,"en":"Nor let the whip-bearers beat you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l003","ordinal":96703,"en":"I shall not let them speak ill of you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l004","ordinal":96704,"en":"I shall not give you a bad name."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l005","ordinal":96705,"en":"If anyone humiliates you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l006","ordinal":96706,"en":"I shall not stand by and watch!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l007","ordinal":96707,"en":"I myself shall take charge of your prize,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l008","ordinal":96708,"en":"And gather it all together."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l009","ordinal":96709,"en":"'How are you faring?'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l010","ordinal":96710,"en":"I shall come calling in due season,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l011","ordinal":96711,"en":"And keep my eyes upon you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l012","ordinal":96712,"en":"I shall sit and talk with you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l013","ordinal":96713,"en":"'How are you faring?'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l014","ordinal":96714,"en":"Seven times I shall ask!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l015","ordinal":96715,"en":"I shall truly watch over you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l016","ordinal":96716,"en":"If the true Almighty supports me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l017","ordinal":96717,"en":"Sister, I myself shall"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l018","ordinal":96718,"en":"Make you my holy shrine!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l019","ordinal":96719,"en":"My ill-fated, hollow-browed one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l020","ordinal":96720,"en":"Bereft of your sovereign,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l021","ordinal":96721,"en":"To Temir Khan's city"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l022","ordinal":96722,"en":"You came wandering, my poor one!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l023","ordinal":96723,"en":"Oh, sister, unfortunate slavewoman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l024","ordinal":96724,"en":"You have no waist to gird,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l025","ordinal":96725,"en":"You fled and came here in earnest,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l026","ordinal":96726,"en":"Without your renowned Kyrgyz people."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l027","ordinal":96727,"en":"There is no sieve over people's mouths."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l028","ordinal":96728,"en":"Saying, 'I shall race my horse in Bukhara,'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l029","ordinal":96729,"en":"Do not become a needless laughingstock."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l030","ordinal":96730,"en":"Do not let dust catch your eyes;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l031","ordinal":96731,"en":"Letting them call you a hell-bound woman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l032","ordinal":96732,"en":"Do not let the enemy sap your strength!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l033","ordinal":96733,"en":"My accomplished sister, my poor one,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l035","ordinal":96734,"en":"Letting them call you a widow,","gapBefore":"[Source wording unresolved; translation pending]"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l036","ordinal":96735,"en":"Sister, do not reveal your widowhood!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l037","ordinal":96736,"en":"I myself shall claim your prize,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l038","ordinal":96737,"en":"And, refusing to let them call you a widow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b003:l039","ordinal":96738,"en":"I shall watch over you closely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l001","ordinal":96739,"en":"Do not let your face brush the level ground;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l002","ordinal":96740,"en":"Letting them call you a shameless woman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l003","ordinal":96741,"en":"Do not let just anyone sap your strength!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l004","ordinal":96742,"en":"Do not let your hem touch the earth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l005","ordinal":96743,"en":"Letting them call you a wandering woman,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l006","ordinal":96744,"en":"Do not torment me so!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l007","ordinal":96745,"en":"Saying this, Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l008","ordinal":96746,"en":"Raised his cry of 'Manas!'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l009","ordinal":96747,"en":"The racer Taytoru"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l010","ordinal":96748,"en":"He urged onward to Bukhara!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l011","ordinal":96749,"en":"Once Semetey took Taytoru in hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l012","ordinal":96750,"en":"Then your dear mother Kanykei—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l013","ordinal":96751,"en":"God's sun clouded over in the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l014","ordinal":96752,"en":"Sixty cares came upon her head at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l015","ordinal":96753,"en":"Her poor heart was divided."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l016","ordinal":96754,"en":"Her only child, gained through such hardship,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l017","ordinal":96755,"en":"Appeared before her on the road."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l018","ordinal":96756,"en":"When she saw her orphan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l019","ordinal":96757,"en":"Grieving, weeping and distraught,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l020","ordinal":96758,"en":"Before God whose command is mighty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l021","ordinal":96759,"en":"Before his command, your mother"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l022","ordinal":96760,"en":"Offered prayers and supplications:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l023","ordinal":96761,"en":"'Now that my son has taken his horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l024","ordinal":96762,"en":"Why should I go after him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l025","ordinal":96763,"en":"Since God has expressly granted this,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l026","ordinal":96764,"en":"Since my Taytoru has come out in front,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l027","ordinal":96765,"en":"Since the owner has taken his horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l028","ordinal":96766,"en":"Since my darling, gained through such hardship,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l029","ordinal":96767,"en":"Has himself begun to urge it onward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0261:b004:l030","ordinal":96768,"en":"By bustling along behind him,"}]
